### Pack B5 health
GET http://localhost:5063/api/v5/ai/private-model-gateway/health

### Validate local private endpoint
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/ai/private-model-gateway/policies/validate-endpoint
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpointCode": "local-private-mock",
  "providerType": "local-mock-private",
  "modelVersion": "local-private-mock-v1",
  "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1/private-model-gateway/mock",
  "networkBoundary": "local-airgap-mock",
  "zeroDataRetentionConfirmed": true,
  "dataResidencyRegion": "local-dev",
  "customerKeyReference": "local-dev-no-secret-key-reference",
  "isByom": true
}

### Prove public AI endpoint is rejected
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/ai/private-model-gateway/policies/no-public-ai-proof

### Record governance event
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/ai/private-model-gateway/governance/record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpointCode": "local-private-mock",
  "modelVersion": "local-private-mock-v1",
  "prompt": "Why did ADV_COIL4002 receive hold decision?",
  "response": "The hold decision is linked to the QA sample and surface signal. [qa:ADV_QA4002]",
  "retrievedHandles": ["qa:ADV_QA4002", "coil:ADV_COIL4002"],
  "citations": ["qa:ADV_QA4002"],
  "grounded": true,
  "abstained": false
}

### Run golden eval
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/ai/private-model-gateway/eval/run-golden
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpointCode": "local-private-mock",
  "modelVersion": "local-private-mock-v1",
  "threshold": 0.95
}